## How Much Does SEO Cost in the UK?

SEO costs start from £495 for an audit; monthly retainers from £1,500. Pricing depends on service scope, competition level, website size, and engagement type. One-off projects suit businesses wanting strategic direction, whilst monthly retainers support sustained implementation delivering compounding results over time.

